    "description": "<p>A true horseman of the plains is loath to leave his mount and companion behind, especially in battle, but there is power in this technique. Riding faster than the wind, the horse stops at the command of its master who, leaning forward, launches off his partner's back at his enemies. He gifts a target with a single strike of his spear or arrow from his bow. Should the character choose the spear, the attack has so much force that it cannot be parried without using a Charm. If he attacks with an arrow, it moves so quickly that the target cannot dodge without using a Charm. Finally, add a number of dice equal to the martial artist's Essence to the attack's raw damage.</p>",
